//~ FLICK-U006 @16:17-16:29 `Atom.derived` while rendering
//~ FLICK-U006 @26:44-26:58 `Action.exhaust` while rendering
//~ FLICK-U006 @36:48-36:55 `Ui.view` while rendering
//~ FLICK-U006 @40:14-40:23 `Atom.make` while rendering
//~ FLICK-U002 @57:7-61:11 `Ui.Event.exhaust` of a `fun` makes a handler on every render
